---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Nav from '../../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import { heroSrcset, gallerySrcset } from '../../utils/images';
---

<Layout
  title="The Art | Toile Blanche | Saint-Paul de Vence"
  description="It is not a hotel that has acquired some paintings. It is an artwork that also happens to have twenty-two suites, two restaurants, and exceptional rosé."
  ogImage="https://www.toileblanche.com/assets/images/art/StP25-ToileBlanche-c-GaelleSimon-36.jpg"
>
  <Nav theme="both" />

  <main id="main-content">
    <!-- HERO -->
    <section class="art-hero">
      <div class="art-hero-image">
        <img src="/assets/images/art/StP25-ToileBlanche-c-GaelleSimon-36.jpg" srcset={heroSrcset('/assets/images/art/StP25-ToileBlanche-c-GaelleSimon-36.jpg')} sizes="100vw" width="4898" height="3265" alt="Contemporary art and sculpture in the gardens of Toile Blanche, Saint-Paul de Vence" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" />
        <div class="art-hero-overlay"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="art-hero-content">
        <p class="art-hero-eyebrow">THE ART</p>
        <h1>In 2026, Toile Blanche was declared a work by the Leroy Brothers. It continues to operate normally.</h1>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- STATEMENT -->
    <section class="art-statement">
      <div class="art-statement-inner">
        <p>That line contains everything worth knowing about this place's relationship with art. It is not a hotel that has acquired some paintings. It is an artwork that also happens to have twenty-two suites, two restaurants, and exceptional rosé.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- VISION + COLLECTION -->
    <section class="art-narrative">
      <div class="art-narrative-inner">
        <div class="art-narrative-text">
          <h2>The Vision</h2>
          <p>The works here are chosen, not accumulated. Each piece was selected by the Leroy Brothers — who are themselves artists — in conversation with the people who made them. Some were created specifically for the property. Others arrived because they belonged here.</p>
          <p>The result is a collection without a fixed boundary. It is not the sort of thing you finish looking at.</p>
          <h2>The Collection</h2>
          <p>The collection spans painting, sculpture, photography, and installation. It is a living entity — not in the way hotels use that phrase to mean they occasionally rotate the lobby prints, but in the sense that new work arrives each season, existing work is reconsidered, and the conversation between the pieces and the rooms they inhabit is ongoing.</p>
          <p>Staying here more than once means encountering a different property. The architecture does not change. The light does not change. But the works do, and they are the walls.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="art-ecosystem">
          <p class="art-ecosystem-label">The Ecosystem</p>

          <div class="art-ecosystem-block">
            <h3>Leroy Brothers</h3>
            <p>Nicolas, Gilles and Gregory Leroy have worked as a collective since 1997, always moving between studios in the South of France and beyond. Their practice intertwines art, technology, and the evolving concept of artistic identity — work that has always refused to stay on a screen, insisting instead on a physical presence in the world. Toile Blanche is the fullest expression of that instinct.</p>
            <a href="https://leroybrothers.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">The artist website &rarr;</a>
          </div>

          <div class="art-ecosystem-block">
            <h3>Toile Blanche Contemporary</h3>
            <p>The studio and gallery at the heart of the estate. A working space, not a showroom — where new pieces are made, exhibited, and archived. Open to guests.</p>
            <a href="https://toileblanchecontemporary.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Explore the gallery &rarr;</a>
          </div>

          <div class="art-ecosystem-block">
            <h3>RAD/ART</h3>
            <p>The contemporary art trail for Saint-Paul de Vence. The village has a rich artistic history, and contemporary art has earned its place here again — through the Fondation Maeght, the CAB Foundation, the Biennale of Saint-Paul, and the galleries that have made the village a working part of the art world rather than a monument to it. RAD/ART maps what is worth seeing, updated for people who already know the obvious names.</p>
            <a href="https://radart.net/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Visit RAD/ART &rarr;</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- GALLERY PAIR -->
    <section class="art-gallery-pair">
      <div class="art-gallery-pair-inner">
        <div class="art-gallery-tall">
          <img src="/assets/images/art/ervinck-1.jpg" srcset={gallerySrcset('/assets/images/art/ervinck-1.jpg')} sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 55vw" width="2917" height="3898" alt="Art installation at Toile Blanche" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
        <div class="art-gallery-offset">
          <img src="/assets/images/art/IMG_0365.jpg" srcset={gallerySrcset('/assets/images/art/IMG_0365.jpg')} sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 45vw" width="4032" height="2717" alt="Gallery interior at Toile Blanche" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- SCULPTURE GARDEN -->
    <section class="art-quote">
      <div class="art-quote-inner">
        <h2>A living gallery of contemporary sculptures scattered across 20,000m² of Provençal gardens.</h2>
        <p>From Arik Levy to Gregory Orekhov, and the foundational works of Raymond Leroy. Each piece tells a story of resistance, light, and the Mediterranean landscape.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- GALLERY (masonry, artgallery images) -->
    <section class="art-gallery">
      <div class="art-gallery-item">
        <img src="/assets/images/art/artgallery/DSCF1307.jpeg" srcset={gallerySrcset('/assets/images/art/artgallery/DSCF1307.jpeg')} sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 50vw" alt="Sculpture in the gardens of Toile Blanche" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
      <div class="art-gallery-item">
        <img src="/assets/images/art/artgallery/DSCF1318.jpeg" srcset={gallerySrcset('/assets/images/art/artgallery/DSCF1318.jpeg')} sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 50vw" alt="Contemporary art at Toile Blanche" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
      <div class="art-gallery-item">
        <img src="/assets/images/art/artgallery/DSCF1343.jpeg" srcset={gallerySrcset('/assets/images/art/artgallery/DSCF1343.jpeg')} sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 50vw" alt="Art installation in Saint-Paul de Vence" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
      <div class="art-gallery-item">
        <img src="/assets/images/art/artgallery/DSCF1385.jpeg" srcset={gallerySrcset('/assets/images/art/artgallery/DSCF1385.jpeg')} sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 50vw" alt="Sculpture garden at Toile Blanche" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
      <div class="art-gallery-item">
        <img src="/assets/images/art/artgallery/DSCF4517.JPG" srcset={gallerySrcset('/assets/images/art/artgallery/DSCF4517.JPG')} sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 50vw" alt="Artwork at Toile Blanche" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
      <div class="art-gallery-item">
        <img src="/assets/images/art/artgallery/DSCF4566.JPG" srcset={gallerySrcset('/assets/images/art/artgallery/DSCF4566.JPG')} sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 50vw" alt="Gardens and sculptures at Toile Blanche" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
      <div class="art-gallery-item">
        <img src="/assets/images/art/artgallery/IMG_9658.jpg" srcset={gallerySrcset('/assets/images/art/artgallery/IMG_9658.jpg')} sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 50vw" alt="Mediterranean landscape and contemporary sculpture at Toile Blanche" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
      <div class="art-gallery-item">
        <img src="/assets/images/art/artgallery/StP25-ToileBlanche-c-GaelleSimon-8.jpg" srcset={gallerySrcset('/assets/images/art/artgallery/StP25-ToileBlanche-c-GaelleSimon-8.jpg')} sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 50vw" alt="Toile Blanche sculpture gardens" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <section class="art-cta">
      <p>Experience the artwork.</p>
      <a href="#" class="art-cta-btn distributor-open">Book Your Stay</a>
    </section>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>

<style>
  /* ─── HERO ─── */
  .art-hero {
    position: relative;
    height: 85vh;
    min-height: 500px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .art-hero-image {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
  }
  .art-hero-image img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }
  .art-hero-overlay {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(0,0,0,0.5) 0%, transparent 55%);
  }
  .art-hero-content {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    padding: 0 80px 72px;
    color: #fff;
  }
  .art-hero-eyebrow {
    font-family: 'Didact Gothic', sans-serif;
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    opacity: 0.8;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    color: #fff;
  }
  .art-hero-content h1 {
    font-family: 'Gilda Display', serif;
    font-size: clamp(36px, 5vw, 72px);
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.1;
    color: #fff;
  }

  /* ─── STATEMENT ─── */
  .art-statement {
    border-bottom: 1px solid #E2D9CC;
  }
  .art-statement-inner {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 64px 80px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .art-statement-inner p {
    font-family: 'Gilda Display', serif;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: clamp(20px, 2.5vw, 28px);
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: #3D3530;
  }

  /* ─── NARRATIVE + ECOSYSTEM ─── */
  .art-narrative {
    border-bottom: 1px solid #E2D9CC;
  }
  .art-narrative-inner {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 80px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 80px;
    align-items: start;
  }
  .art-narrative-text h2 {
    font-family: 'Gilda Display', serif;
    font-size: clamp(24px, 3vw, 36px);
    font-weight: 400;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    color: #1C1917;
  }
  .art-narrative-text h2:not(:first-child) {
    margin-top: 48px;
  }
  .art-narrative-text p {
    font-family: 'Didact Gothic', sans-serif;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: #3D3530;
  }

  .art-ecosystem {
    padding: 48px;
    background: rgba(226, 217, 204, 0.15);
  }
  .art-ecosystem-label {
    font-family: 'Didact Gothic', sans-serif;
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #9C9080;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }
  .art-ecosystem-block {
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }
  .art-ecosystem-block:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }
  .art-ecosystem-block h3 {
    font-family: 'Gilda Display', serif;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 22px;
    color: #1C1917;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .art-ecosystem-block p {
    font-family: 'Didact Gothic', sans-serif;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #6B6256;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .art-ecosystem-block a {
    font-family: 'Didact Gothic', sans-serif;
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: #9e5c4a;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #9e5c4a;
    padding-bottom: 2px;
    transition: opacity 0.2s;
  }
  .art-ecosystem-block a:hover {
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  /* ─── GALLERY PAIR ─── */
  .art-gallery-pair {
    border-bottom: 1px solid #E2D9CC;
  }
  .art-gallery-pair-inner {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 80px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr;
    gap: 40px;
    align-items: start;
  }
  .art-gallery-tall img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    object-fit: contain;
    display: block;
  }
  .art-gallery-offset {
    padding-top: 120px;
  }
  .art-gallery-offset img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    object-fit: contain;
    display: block;
  }
  .art-gallery-caption {
    font-family: 'Didact Gothic', sans-serif;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: #9C9080;
    margin-top: 16px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  /* ─── QUOTE / SCULPTURE GARDEN ─── */
  .art-quote {
    border-bottom: 1px solid #E2D9CC;
  }
  .art-quote-inner {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 96px 80px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .art-quote-inner h2 {
    font-family: 'Gilda Display', serif;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: clamp(24px, 3.5vw, 44px);
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.3;
    color: #1C1917;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }
  .art-quote-inner p {
    font-family: 'Didact Gothic', sans-serif;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: #6B6256;
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  /* ─── GALLERY (masonry, like guinguette/restaurant) ─── */
  .art-gallery {
    border-bottom: 1px solid #E2D9CC;
    columns: 2;
    column-gap: 4px;
    line-height: 0;
  }
  .art-gallery-item {
    break-inside: avoid;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
    overflow: hidden;
    line-height: 0;
  }
  .art-gallery-item img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
    transition: transform 0.8s ease;
  }
  .art-gallery-item:hover img {
    transform: scale(1.03);
  }

  /* ─── CTA ─── */
  .art-cta {
    padding: 80px;
    text-align: center;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #E2D9CC;
  }
  .art-cta p {
    font-family: 'Gilda Display', serif;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: clamp(20px, 2.5vw, 28px);
    color: #3D3530;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }
  .art-cta-btn {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: 'Didact Gothic', sans-serif;
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: #FAF8F3;
    background: #9e5c4a;
    padding: 16px 36px;
    transition: opacity 0.2s;
  }
  .art-cta-btn:hover {
    opacity: 0.85;
  }

  /* ─── RESPONSIVE ─── */
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .art-hero-content {
      padding: 0 24px 48px;
    }
    .art-statement-inner {
      padding: 48px 24px;
    }
    .art-narrative-inner {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      padding: 48px 24px;
      gap: 40px;
    }
    .art-gallery-pair-inner {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      padding: 48px 24px;
      gap: 24px;
    }
    .art-gallery-offset {
      padding-top: 0;
    }
    .art-quote-inner {
      padding: 64px 24px;
    }
    .art-cta {
      padding: 48px 24px;
    }
  }
</style>
